(()=>{const photos=[['sala','Sala de estar e jantar'],['cozinha','Cozinha integrada'],['quarto','Quarto decorado'],['fachada','Fachada conceitual'],['entrada','Portaria e acesso pela rua']];let current=0;const q=s=>document.querySelector(s);function show(i){current=(i+photos.length)%photos.length;const [file,title]=photos[current];q('#galleryMain').src='galeria-'+file+'.png';q('#galleryMain').alt=title+' — imagem ilustrativa gerada por IA';q('#galleryCaption').textContent=title;q('#galleryCount').textContent=(current+1)+' / 5';q('#galleryThumbs').querySelectorAll('button').forEach((b,j)=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(j===current)));}q('#galleryThumbs').innerHTML=photos.map(([file,title],i)=>'<button aria-label="Ver '+title+'" aria-pressed="'+(i===0)+'"><img src="galeria-'+file+'.png" alt="" loading="lazy"></button>').join('');q('#galleryThumbs').querySelectorAll('button').forEach((b,i)=>b.onclick=()=>show(i));q('#galleryPrev').onclick=()=>show(current-1);q('#galleryNext').onclick=()=>show(current+1);})();